rove query performance.\n\nIn summary, the query rewrite rule applies to Case 1 by moving conditions into the ON clause or as a WHERE clause on a subquery to reduce the size of datasets before the join occurs. The logical plan changes after rewriting show that several conditions were moved into the ON clause or as a WHERE clause on a subquery, which can improve query performance.", 'time': 6.240032434463501}
