UE conditions.\n\n```python\n["FILTER_PROJECT_TRANSPOSE", "AGGREGATE_PROJECT_MERGE", "PROJECT_FILTER_TRANSPOSE", "AGGREGATE_REDUCE_FUNCTIONS", "JOIN_DERIVE_IS_NOT_NULL_FILTER_RULE", "JOIN_EXTRACT_FILTER", "JOIN_ADD_REDUNDANT_SEMI_JOIN"]\n```', 'time': 4.0959625244140625}
